    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Table&nbsp;10.02</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Common sites involved by IgG4-related disease (IgG4-RD) and the salient clinical features</span></p>",
